---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Process Audit for AI - Find Your Automation Goldmines" description="A dead-simple framework to identify which processes in your business are ripe for AI transformation">
  <article class="audit-page">
    <section class="hero-audit">
      <div class="audit-badge">Rabbit Hole / Speedier</div>
      <h1>The Process Audit</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Find your automation goldmines in 6 simple steps</p>
      <p class="sub-tagline">No PhD required. No consultants needed. Just you, a whiteboard, and 2 hours.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section intro-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Why This Matters</h2>
      <div class="intro-content">
        <p>
          Everyone's talking about AI. But where do you actually <strong>start</strong>?
        </p>
        <p>
          Not with the technology. Not with vendors. Not with strategy decks.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>You start by understanding what you actually do.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="insight-box">
          <span class="insight-icon">!</span>
          <p>Most businesses have 3-5 processes that are <em>perfect</em> for AI automation. The problem? Nobody's mapped them. This audit fixes that.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section framework-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">The 6-Step Framework</h2>
      <p class="framework-intro">Dead simple. Do it in a morning. Transform your business in months.</p>
      
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card" id="step1">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Define Your Why</h3>
          <p class="step-question">What are you trying to achieve?</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>Cut costs by 20%?</li>
            <li>Speed up delivery by 40%?</li>
            <li>Reduce errors to near-zero?</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">15 mins</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Sticky notes on wall</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" id="step2">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>List Your Processes</h3>
          <p class="step-question">What does your team actually do all day?</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>How do orders get processed?</li>
            <li>How do you hire people?</li>
            <li>How do you handle customer complaints?</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">30 mins</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Simple spreadsheet</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" id="step3">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Map the Flow</h3>
          <p class="step-question">Draw each process start-to-finish</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>Who does what?</li>
            <li>What data moves where?</li>
            <li>Where does it get stuck?</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">45 mins</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Whiteboard or Miro</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" id="step4">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <h3>Score for AI Potential</h3>
          <p class="step-question">Rate each process 1-10</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>Is it repetitive? (+3)</li>
            <li>Is it data-heavy? (+3)</li>
            <li>Is it rule-based? (+2)</li>
            <li>Is it high-volume? (+2)</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">20 mins</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Scoring matrix</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" id="step5">
          <div class="step-number">5</div>
          <h3>Pick Your Quick Win</h3>
          <p class="step-question">Start with ONE process</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>Highest score = best candidate</li>
            <li>Start small, prove value</li>
            <li>Build momentum for bigger projects</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">10 mins</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Decision matrix</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" id="step6">
          <div class="step-number">6</div>
          <h3>Build & Learn</h3>
          <p class="step-question">Pilot, measure, iterate</p>
          <ul class="step-examples">
            <li>Run a 2-week pilot</li>
            <li>Measure against your "why"</li>
            <li>Expand what works</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="step-time">Ongoing</div>
          <div class="step-tool">Tool: Your new AI system</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section beleaf-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">How BeLeaf Did It</h2>
      <p class="beleaf-intro">Watch how our synthetic business ran this audit - and what they discovered.</p>
      
      <div class="beleaf-story">
        <div class="story-chapter">
          <div class="chapter-header">
            <span class="chapter-num">Scene 1</span>
            <h3>The Monday Morning Meeting</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <p>
              Marcus Chen (CEO) gathered his leadership team in the Bristol HQ. The problem was clear:
              <strong>they were growing, but the cracks were showing.</strong>
            </p>
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker ceo">Marcus:</div>
              <div class="speech">"We're processing 200 orders a day manually. Fatima's team is drowning in data. And we just lost another customer because a shipment got stuck in our 'system'."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker cto">Priya (CTO):</div>
              <div class="speech">"I've heard AI can help. But I don't even know where to start."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker ceo">Marcus:</div>
              <div class="speech">"That's why we're doing this audit. Two hours. No consultants. Let's figure out where we're bleeding time."</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-chapter">
          <div class="chapter-header">
            <span class="chapter-num">Scene 2</span>
            <h3>The Whiteboard Session</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <p>They mapped 6 core processes:</p>
            <div class="process-list">
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">Order Processing</span>
                <span class="process-score high">Score: 9/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Manual, repetitive, high volume</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">Inventory Alerts</span>
                <span class="process-score high">Score: 8/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Rule-based, data-heavy</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">Customer Onboarding</span>
                <span class="process-score medium">Score: 6/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Semi-manual, relationship-heavy</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">Supplier Coordination</span>
                <span class="process-score high">Score: 8/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Complex routing, lots of data</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">HR Recruitment</span>
                <span class="process-score medium">Score: 7/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Document-heavy screening</span>
              </div>
              <div class="process-item">
                <span class="process-name">Financial Reporting</span>
                <span class="process-score medium">Score: 6/10</span>
                <span class="process-why">Quarterly, complex judgments</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-chapter">
          <div class="chapter-header">
            <span class="chapter-num">Scene 3</span>
            <h3>The Decision</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker ceo">Marcus:</div>
              <div class="speech">"Order Processing scored highest. But it's also our most critical. Too risky for a first experiment."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker cto">Priya:</div>
              <div class="speech">"What about Inventory Alerts? It's high-scoring, rule-based, and if we mess it up... we just get a few extra notifications. Low risk."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dialogue">
              <div class="speaker cmo">Aisha (CMO):</div>
              <div class="speech">"And if it works, it proves AI to the rest of the team. Momentum."</div>
            </div>
            <div class="decision-box">
              <strong>BeLeaf's Quick Win:</strong> Automated Inventory Alerts
              <p>2-week pilot with AI agents monitoring stock levels and auto-notifying suppliers</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-chapter">
          <div class="chapter-header">
            <span class="chapter-num">Scene 4</span>
            <h3>The Results</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="chapter-content">
            <div class="results-grid">
              <div class="result-card">
                <span class="result-value">847</span>
                <span class="result-label">Hours saved in first quarter</span>
              </div>
              <div class="result-card">
                <span class="result-value">23%</span>
                <span class="result-label">Reduction in stockouts</span>
              </div>
              <div class="result-card">
                <span class="result-value">5</span>
                <span class="result-label">Agents now running</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="results-note">
              After proving Inventory Alerts worked, BeLeaf expanded to Supplier Coordination and Order Processing.
              <strong>The audit took 2 hours. The transformation took 3 months.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section interactive-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Try It Yourself</h2>
      <div class="interactive-tool">
        <h3>Quick Process Scorer</h3>
        <p>Rate a process in your business right now. Just click the options that apply.</p>
        
        <div class="scorer-form">
          <div class="scorer-question">
            <label>Process name:</label>
            <input type="text" id="processName" placeholder="e.g., Invoice Processing" />
          </div>
          
          <div class="scorer-checkboxes">
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="3" />
              <span>It's repetitive (same steps every time)</span>
              <span class="points">+3</span>
            </label>
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="3" />
              <span>It involves lots of data</span>
              <span class="points">+3</span>
            </label>
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="2" />
              <span>It follows clear rules</span>
              <span class="points">+2</span>
            </label>
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="2" />
              <span>It happens frequently (daily/weekly)</span>
              <span class="points">+2</span>
            </label>
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="1" />
              <span>It currently takes significant time</span>
              <span class="points">+1</span>
            </label>
            <label class="check-item">
              <input type="checkbox" class="score-check" data-points="1" />
              <span>Errors here cost money/reputation</span>
              <span class="points">+1</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          
          <div class="scorer-result">
            <span class="result-label">AI Potential Score:</span>
            <span class="result-score" id="totalScore">0</span>
            <span class="result-max">/ 12</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="scorer-verdict" id="verdict">
            <p>Check some boxes to see your rating!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-section">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <h3>Ready to Find Your Goldmines?</h3>
        <p>I can facilitate this audit with your team - and build the first AI solution in weeks.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/beleaf/" class="cta-primary">See BeLeaf in Action</a>
          <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Process%20Audit%20Request" class="cta-secondary">Book an Audit Session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="article-footer">
      <div class="s-formula">
        <span class="s-tag speedier">Speedier</span>
        <span class="s-tag smarter">Smarter</span>
        <span class="plus">+</span>
        <span class="s-tag simpler">Simpler</span>
        <span class="equals">=</span>
        <span class="s-tag smilier">Smilier</span>
      </div>
      <div class="related-links">
        <h4>Go Deeper</h4>
        <a href="/rabbit-holes/agentic-overview/">Agentic AI Operations</a>
        <a href="/beleaf/">Meet BeLeaf</a>
        <a href="/services/">How We Work</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  // Interactive Scorer
  document.querySelectorAll('.score-check').forEach(checkbox => {
    checkbox.addEventListener('change', updateScore);
  });

  function updateScore() {
    let total = 0;
    document.querySelectorAll('.score-check:checked').forEach(cb => {
      total += parseInt(cb.dataset.points);
    });
    
    document.getElementById('totalScore').textContent = total;
    
    const verdict = document.getElementById('verdict');
    if (total === 0) {
      verdict.innerHTML = '<p>Check some boxes to see your rating!</p>';
    } else if (total <= 4) {
      verdict.innerHTML = '<p class="verdict-low">Low AI potential. This process likely needs human judgment.</p>';
    } else if (total <= 7) {
      verdict.innerHTML = '<p class="verdict-medium">Medium potential. AI could assist but not fully automate.</p>';
    } else if (total <= 10) {
      verdict.innerHTML = '<p class="verdict-high">High potential! This is a strong candidate for AI automation.</p>';
    } else {
      verdict.innerHTML = '<p class="verdict-excellent">Excellent candidate! This process is screaming for AI. Start here.</p>';
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .audit-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-audit {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .audit-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-audit h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .sub-tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .insight-box {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .insight-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .insight-box p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* Steps Grid */
  .framework-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .step-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15px;
    left: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .step-question {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .step-examples {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  }

  .step-examples li {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-examples li::before {
    content: '-';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .step-time {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .step-tool {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* BeLeaf Story */
  .beleaf-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .beleaf-story {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .story-chapter {
    background: #0f0f0f;
    border-left: 3px solid #2D5016;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .chapter-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .chapter-num {
    background: #2D5016;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chapter-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .chapter-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .dialogue {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .speaker {
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .speaker.ceo { color: var(--accent); }
  .speaker.cto { color: #9C27B0; }
  .speaker.cmo { color: #2196F3; }

  .speech {
    color: #ccc;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .process-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .process-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .process-name {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .process-score {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .process-score.high { background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2); color: #4CAF50; }
  .process-score.medium { background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.2); color: #FFC107; }

  .process-why {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .decision-box {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .decision-box p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .results-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .result-card {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .result-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .result-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .results-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Interactive Scorer */
  .interactive-tool {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .interactive-tool h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .interactive-tool > p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .scorer-question {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .scorer-question label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .scorer-question input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .scorer-checkboxes {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .check-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .check-item:hover {
    background: #151515;
  }

  .check-item input {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .check-item span:first-of-type {
    flex: 1;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .points {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .scorer-result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .scorer-result .result-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .scorer-result .result-score {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .scorer-result .result-max {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .scorer-verdict {
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #0a0a0a;
  }

  .scorer-verdict p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .verdict-low { color: #F44336; }
  .verdict-medium { color: #FFC107; }
  .verdict-high { color: #4CAF50; }
  .verdict-excellent { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2);
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-box p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
